# A subroutine called from two places. The CP1 has no call instruction, so the caller first stores
# Start: 000 PC RUN
# the address to come back to in cell 050; the subroutine ends with the indirect jump SIU 050.
# The subroutine (from 030) flashes the display: it shows 11.111 and then 00.000.

000 ako 04.003
001 abs 06.050
002 spu 09.030
003 ako 04.001
004 anz 02.000
005 vzg 03.250
006 vzg 03.250
007 ako 04.010
008 abs 06.050
009 spu 09.030
010 ako 04.002
011 anz 02.000
012 spu 09.012
030 lda 05.051
031 anz 02.000
032 vzg 03.250
033 ako 04.000
034 anz 02.000
035 vzg 03.250
036 siu 21.050
051 spb 11.111
